<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="夜に駆ける"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YOASOBI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="夜に駆ける - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1490256995"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">宛若下沉 宛若悄然消融</text><text for="L2">在唯属于你我的浩瀚夜色之中</text><text for="L3">只是一声「再见」 那一句话便让我明了一切</text><text for="L4">夕阳渐沉的天幕与你的身影</text><text for="L5">隔着围栏与夕色重叠相映</text><text for="L6">自我们初次相逢的那天起</text><text for="L7">你便掠走了我整颗心</text><text for="L8">带着几分缥缈脆弱气息的你</text><text for="L9">眼神总是那般孤寂落寞</text><text for="L10">秒针滴答回荡的世界里 无论经历多少次</text><text for="L11">面对无心伤人的话语与刺耳喧嚣 哪怕泪水几欲夺眶</text><text for="L12">只要你我携手 平凡的幸福也一定能寻获</text><text for="L13">献给在喧闹日子里无法展颜的你</text><text for="L14">竭尽全力奉上最璀璨耀眼的明天</text><text for="L15">在坠入不见天日的永夜之前</text><text for="L16">快牵起我的手吧</text><text for="L17">哪怕是想要遗忘而深锁心底的往昔</text><text for="L18">也都会在相拥的温度中悉数消融</text><text for="L19">别害怕 直到旭日东升之时</text><text for="L20">我们便一直相伴</text><text for="L21">我讨厌凝视着唯独你能看见之物的你</text><text for="L22">仿若为之沉醉 宛如陷入恋慕</text><text for="L23">那样的神情最令我讨厌</text><text for="L24">渴望相信却终难释怀 无论怎么做</text><text for="L25">往后必定还会接踵而至 难道每次都要这般愤怒与落泪吗</text><text for="L26">可纵使如此 终有一天我们也必定</text><text for="L27">能够心意相通 我始终坚信不疑</text><text for="L28">哭喊着「受够了 真的好累」</text><text for="L29">断然甩开我拼命伸出之手的你</text><text for="L30">「我受够了 已经累了」这样的话 实际上我也想倾吐而出</text><text for="L31">看吧 秒针再次滴答鸣响的世界 无论经历多少回</text><text for="L32">为你准备的宽慰之词无一能够传达 「好想就此结束」这样的话语</text><text for="L33">当我身不由己脱口而出的瞬间 你却初次绽开了笑颜</text><text for="L34">在这喧嚣日常里早已失去笑容的</text><text for="L35">倒映在我眼底的你 竟是这般美丽</text><text for="L36">在漫漫长夜里决堤而出的泪水</text><text for="L37">也都悄然消融在你的笑靥里</text><text for="L38">对着在日复一日的沉闷中暗自垂泪的我</text><text for="L39">你以温柔将我诱向终结</text><text for="L40">如缓缓沉落 似渐渐消融</text><text for="L41">深锁心头的浓雾终于散尽</text><text for="L42">向着那些想要遗忘而尘封的往日</text><text for="L43">我握住了你主动向我伸来的手</text><text for="L44">微凉的长风仿若漫游夜空 此刻轻盈拂掠而过</text><text for="L45">相牵的双手 请千万不要放开</text><text for="L46">你我二人 此刻纵身奔向漫漫长夜</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:04.087"><div begin="0:01.594" end="4:04.087"><p begin="0:01.594" end="0:06.300" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:01.594" end="0:02.484">沈む</span><span begin="0:02.484" end="0:03.031">よう</span><span begin="0:03.031" end="0:03.294">に</span><span begin="0:03.294" end="0:03.975">溶けて</span><span begin="0:03.975" end="0:04.390">ゆく</span><span begin="0:04.390" end="0:04.891">よう</span><span begin="0:04.891" end="0:06.300">に</span></p><p begin="0:08.953" end="0:15.148" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.953" end="0:09.888">二人</span><span begin="0:09.888" end="0:10.404">だけ</span><span begin="0:10.404" end="0:10.707">の</span><span begin="0:10.707" end="0:11.070">空</span><span begin="0:11.070" end="0:11.329">が</span><span begin="0:11.329" end="0:11.800">広</span><span begin="0:11.800" end="0:12.407">がる</span><span begin="0:12.488" end="0:13.001">夜</span><span begin="0:13.001" end="0:15.148">に</span></p><p begin="0:31.535" end="0:37.831" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.535" end="0:31.635">「</span><span begin="0:31.635" end="0:32.577">さよなら</span><span begin="0:32.577" end="0:32.677">」</span><span begin="0:32.853" end="0:33.258">だけ</span><span begin="0:33.258" end="0:33.798">だっ</span><span begin="0:33.798" end="0:34.140">た</span> <span begin="0:34.266" end="0:34.841">その</span><span begin="0:34.841" end="0:35.548">一言</span><span begin="0:35.548" end="0:35.780">で</span><span begin="0:35.780" end="0:36.179">全</span><span begin="0:36.179" end="0:36.748">てが</span><span begin="0:36.748" end="0:37.274">分かっ</span><span begin="0:37.274" end="0:37.831">た</span></p><p begin="0:37.831" end="0:42.187" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.831" end="0:38.310">日が</span><span begin="0:38.310" end="0:39.086">沈み</span><span begin="0:39.086" end="0:39.717">出した</span><span begin="0:39.717" end="0:40.333">空</span><span begin="0:40.333" end="0:40.643">と</span><span begin="0:40.716" end="0:41.258">君の</span><span begin="0:41.258" end="0:42.187">姿</span></p><p begin="0:42.187" end="0:45.437" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.187" end="0:42.996">フェンス</span><span begin="0:42.996" end="0:43.493">越し</span><span begin="0:43.493" end="0:43.774">に</span><span begin="0:43.836" end="0:44.345">重</span><span begin="0:44.345" end="0:45.008">なって</span><span begin="0:45.008" end="0:45.437">いた</span></p><p begin="0:46.141" end="0:48.921" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.141" end="0:47.152">初めて</span><span begin="0:47.152" end="0:47.800">会った</span><span begin="0:47.800" end="0:48.017">日</span><span begin="0:48.017" end="0:48.513">か</span><span begin="0:48.513" end="0:48.921">ら</span></p><p begin="0:48.929" end="0:52.609" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.929" end="0:49.631">僕の</span><span begin="0:49.631" end="0:50.529">心の</span><span begin="0:50.529" end="0:51.412">全てを</span><span begin="0:51.412" end="0:52.609">奪った</span></p><p begin="0:52.619" end="0:56.974" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.619" end="0:53.352">どこか</span><span begin="0:53.352" end="0:54.016">儚</span><span begin="0:54.016" end="0:54.229">い</span><span begin="0:54.229" end="0:55.030">空気</span><span begin="0:55.030" end="0:55.355">を</span><span begin="0:55.442" end="0:55.909">纏</span><span begin="0:55.909" end="0:56.063">う</span><span begin="0:56.063" end="0:56.608">君</span><span begin="0:56.608" end="0:56.974">は</span></p><p begin="0:56.982" end="0:59.901" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.982" end="0:57.483">寂</span><span begin="0:57.483" end="0:57.770">し</span><span begin="0:57.770" end="0:57.932">い</span><span begin="0:57.932" end="0:58.281">目</span><span begin="0:58.281" end="0:58.535">を</span><span begin="0:58.644" end="0:59.138">して</span><span begin="0:59.138" end="0:59.499">たん</span><span begin="0:59.499" end="0:59.901">だ</span></p><p begin="1:00.391" end="1:04.074" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.391" end="1:01.152">いつだって</span><span begin="1:01.152" end="1:01.476">チック</span><span begin="1:01.476" end="1:01.824">タック</span><span begin="1:01.824" end="1:02.097">と</span> <span begin="1:02.233" end="1:02.561">鳴る</span><span begin="1:02.561" end="1:02.861">世界</span><span begin="1:02.861" end="1:03.154">で</span><span begin="1:03.154" end="1:03.481">何度</span><span begin="1:03.481" end="1:03.767">だって</span><span begin="1:03.767" end="1:04.074">さ</span></p><p begin="1:04.074" end="1:08.744" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.074" end="1:04.419">触れる</span><span begin="1:04.419" end="1:04.763">心</span><span begin="1:04.763" end="1:05.167">無い</span><span begin="1:05.167" end="1:05.470">言葉</span><span begin="1:05.470" end="1:06.009">うるさい</span><span begin="1:06.009" end="1:06.303">声</span><span begin="1:06.303" end="1:06.500">に</span> <span begin="1:06.500" end="1:06.835">涙</span><span begin="1:06.835" end="1:07.118">が</span><span begin="1:07.348" end="1:07.746">零</span><span begin="1:07.746" end="1:07.945">れ</span><span begin="1:07.945" end="1:08.211">そう</span><span begin="1:08.211" end="1:08.423">で</span><span begin="1:08.423" end="1:08.744">も</span></p><p begin="1:08.744" end="1:14.463" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.744" end="1:09.267">あり</span><span begin="1:09.267" end="1:09.863">きたり</span><span begin="1:09.863" end="1:10.201">な</span><span begin="1:10.201" end="1:10.933">喜び</span><span begin="1:11.085" end="1:11.817">きっと</span><span begin="1:11.817" end="1:12.528">二人</span><span begin="1:12.528" end="1:12.970">なら</span><span begin="1:12.970" end="1:13.634">見つけ</span><span begin="1:13.634" end="1:14.159">られ</span><span begin="1:14.159" end="1:14.463">る</span></p><p begin="1:15.210" end="1:19.102" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.210" end="1:15.732">騒</span><span begin="1:15.732" end="1:15.923">が</span><span begin="1:15.923" end="1:16.240">しい</span><span begin="1:16.250" end="1:16.909">日々</span><span begin="1:16.909" end="1:17.156">に</span><span begin="1:17.156" end="1:17.828">笑え</span><span begin="1:17.828" end="1:18.242">ない</span><span begin="1:18.242" end="1:18.749">君</span><span begin="1:18.749" end="1:19.102">に</span></p><p begin="1:19.115" end="1:22.823" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.115" end="1:19.618">思</span><span begin="1:19.618" end="1:19.887">い</span><span begin="1:19.887" end="1:20.362">付く</span><span begin="1:20.362" end="1:21.032">限り</span><span begin="1:21.032" end="1:21.460">眩</span><span begin="1:21.460" end="1:21.878">しい</span><span begin="1:21.878" end="1:22.451">明日</span><span begin="1:22.451" end="1:22.823">を</span></p><p begin="1:22.833" end="1:26.529" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.833" end="1:23.421">明け</span><span begin="1:23.421" end="1:23.714">ない</span><span begin="1:23.714" end="1:24.253">夜</span><span begin="1:24.253" end="1:24.506">に</span><span begin="1:24.506" end="1:24.919">落ち</span><span begin="1:24.919" end="1:25.170">て</span><span begin="1:25.170" end="1:25.607">ゆく</span><span begin="1:25.607" end="1:26.182">前</span><span begin="1:26.182" end="1:26.529">に</span></p><p begin="1:26.539" end="1:29.574" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.539" end="1:27.220">僕の</span><span begin="1:27.263" end="1:27.667">手を</span><span begin="1:27.667" end="1:28.391">掴ん</span><span begin="1:28.391" end="1:28.634">で</span><span begin="1:28.634" end="1:28.899">ほ</span><span begin="1:28.899" end="1:29.574">ら</span></p><p begin="1:29.574" end="1:33.904" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.574" end="1:30.033">忘</span><span begin="1:30.033" end="1:30.462">れて</span><span begin="1:30.462" end="1:31.061">しまい</span><span begin="1:31.061" end="1:31.281">た</span><span begin="1:31.281" end="1:31.610">く</span><span begin="1:31.610" end="1:31.949">て</span><span begin="1:31.949" end="1:32.370">閉じ</span><span begin="1:32.370" end="1:32.772">込め</span><span begin="1:32.772" end="1:32.961">た</span><span begin="1:32.961" end="1:33.573">日々</span><span begin="1:33.573" end="1:33.904">も</span></p><p begin="1:33.910" end="1:37.606" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.910" end="1:34.380">抱き</span><span begin="1:34.380" end="1:34.944">しめ</span><span begin="1:34.944" end="1:35.112">た</span><span begin="1:35.112" end="1:35.594">温</span><span begin="1:35.594" end="1:36.039">もり</span><span begin="1:36.039" end="1:36.261">で</span><span begin="1:36.297" end="1:36.833">溶かす</span><span begin="1:36.833" end="1:37.180">か</span><span begin="1:37.180" end="1:37.606">ら</span></p><p begin="1:37.616" end="1:41.990" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.616" end="1:38.158">怖</span><span begin="1:38.158" end="1:38.449">く</span><span begin="1:38.449" end="1:39.286">ないよ</span><span begin="1:39.286" end="1:39.989">いつか</span><span begin="1:39.989" end="1:40.385">日が</span><span begin="1:40.385" end="1:40.918">昇</span><span begin="1:41.083" end="1:41.337">る</span><span begin="1:41.337" end="1:41.990">まで</span></p><p begin="1:42.002" end="1:43.806" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.002" end="1:42.680">二人</span><span begin="1:42.680" end="1:42.917">で</span><span begin="1:42.981" end="1:43.476">いよ</span><span begin="1:43.476" end="1:43.806">う</span></p><p begin="1:58.381" end="2:04.630" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.381" end="1:58.725">君</span><span begin="1:58.725" end="1:59.069">に</span><span begin="1:59.069" end="1:59.339">し</span><span begin="1:59.467" end="1:59.757">か</span><